1
00:00:10,305 --> 00:00:13,695
Everybody who works here, and
what each of them can reach.

2
00:00:14,147 --> 00:00:19,673
Inviting somebody starts with what they
will be, not with their email address.

3
00:00:20,125 --> 00:00:28,410
The role they arrive with, and the
workspace they arrive into. Both decided now, by

4
00:00:28,410 --> 00:00:28,809
you.

5
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:33,904
What comes out is a code. Send it
however you already talk to them.

6
00:00:34,356 --> 00:00:41,037
Treat it as a key, because it is one:
whoever types it joins. That is why it

7
00:00:41,037 --> 00:00:41,740
expires.

8
00:00:42,196 --> 00:00:47,444
And why it can be taken back the moment
you have any doubt about where it went.

9
00:00:47,896 --> 00:00:51,890
Next: everything about
one person, in one place.

